        <ExplanationTxt>AS PART OF ITS OPERATION AS A PUBLIC CHARTER SCHOOL, THE ORGANIZATION RECEIVES FINANCIAL ASSISTANCE FROM THE UNITED STATES AND CALIFORNIA DEPARTMENTS OF EDUCATION AS WELL AS LOCAL PROPERTY TAX REVENUE PASSED-THROUGH THE SAN DIEGO UNIFIED SCHOOL DISTRICT. ADDITIONALLY, GOVERNMENTAL AID FOR SPECIAL EDUCATION PROGRAMS ARE PASSED-THROUGH THE EL DORADO SELPA.</ExplanationTxt>
